OpenUI Forge — Anthropic Build generative UI apps with OpenUI + Anthropic Claude. Converts Anthropic streaming events to OpenAI-compatible NDJSON. Activation Triggers "openui anthropic", "openui claude", "openui sonnet" "generative ui claude", "claude streaming ui" Prerequisites Node.js >= 22 (24 LTS recommended), React >= 18.3.1 (19+ recommended) ANTHROPICAPIKEY environment variable set Next.js project (App Router recommended) dependencies: Add the CSS import to app/layout.tsx: Create the API route and frontend page below Run npm run dev and test Full Code Backend: app/api/chat/route.ts The backend streams from Anthropic and converts each event into OpenAI-compatible SSE chunks that openAIAdapter() expects (data: {json}

 lines, terminated by data: [DONE]). Frontend: app/chat/page.tsx The backend emits SSE (data: {json}

). Pair it with openAIAdapter() on the frontend — openAIReadableStreamAdapter() is for NDJSON (no data: prefix) and will silently produce no output here.
